<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Nikes"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Frank Ocean"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Blonde"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="QZ5C81600001"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="426194881"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="190055247"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="DEVILISALIE"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:52.802"><div begin="27.566" end="4:52.802"><p begin="27.566" end="32.200" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.566" end="27.813">These</span> <span begin="27.813" end="27.932">bit</span><span begin="27.932" end="28.159">ches</span> <span begin="28.159" end="28.628">want</span> <span begin="28.628" end="29.236">Ni</span><span begin="29.236" end="32.200">kes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这些泼妇想要买耐克</span></p><p begin="34.597" end="36.046" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.597" end="34.672">They</span> <span begin="34.672" end="34.918">loo</span><span begin="34.918" end="35.146">king</span> <span begin="35.146" end="35.248">for</span> <span begin="35.248" end="35.495">a</span> <span begin="35.495" end="36.046">check</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他们在寻找能为她们开支票的人（check双关支票和耐克logo）</span></p><p begin="37.709" end="41.027" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.709" end="37.959">Tell</span> <span begin="37.959" end="38.220">&apos;em</span> <span begin="38.220" end="38.393">it</span> <span begin="38.393" end="38.832">ain&apos;t</span> <span begin="38.832" end="39.321">like</span><span begin="39.321" end="41.027">ly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">并告诉他们事实并非如此</span></p><p begin="41.629" end="47.322" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.629" end="41.835">Said</span> <span begin="41.835" end="42.064">she</span> <span begin="42.064" end="42.261">need</span> <span begin="42.261" end="42.522">a</span> <span begin="42.522" end="43.158">ring</span> <span begin="43.158" end="43.623">like</span> <span begin="43.623" end="44.131">Car</span><span begin="44.131" end="45.078">me</span><span begin="45.078" end="47.322">lo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她想要一枚戒指，就像卡梅隆·安东尼（Carmelo Anthony，NBA名宿）手上的NBA总冠军戒指</span></p><p begin="48.525" end="54.541" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.525" end="48.650">You</span> <span begin="48.650" end="48.818">must</span> <span begin="48.818" end="49.033">be</span> <span begin="49.033" end="49.217">on</span> <span begin="49.217" end="49.490">that</span> <span begin="49.490" end="50.107">white</span> <span begin="50.107" end="50.508">like</span> <span begin="50.508" end="50.980">O</span><span begin="50.980" end="52.093">thel</span><span begin="52.093" end="54.541">lo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也会像奥赛罗（莎士比亚笔下的黑人角色）那样因为吸了白粉后而情绪高昂</span></p><p begin="55.579" end="59.334" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.579" end="55.782">All</span> <span begin="55.782" end="56.040">you</span> <span begin="56.040" end="56.262">want</span> <span begin="56.262" end="56.501">is</span> <span begin="56.501" end="57.028">Ni</span><span begin="57.028" end="59.334">kes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你只想要神话中的女神</span></p><p begin="59.559" end="1:00.923" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.559" end="59.756">But</span> <span begin="59.756" end="59.974">the</span> <span begin="59.974" end="1:00.532">real</span> <span begin="1:00.532" end="1:00.923">ones</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但是这世界如此真实</span></p><p begin="1:02.781" end="1:05.931" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.781" end="1:03.097">Just</span> <span begin="1:03.097" end="1:03.721">like</span> <span begin="1:03.721" end="1:05.931">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">像你那样</span></p><p begin="1:06.235" end="1:09.628" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.235" end="1:06.603">Just</span> <span begin="1:06.603" end="1:07.239">like</span> <span begin="1:07.239" end="1:09.628">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">像我这样</span></p><p begin="1:10.264" end="1:15.770" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.264" end="1:10.386">I</span> <span begin="1:10.386" end="1:10.781">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:10.781" end="1:12.353">play,</span> <span begin="1:12.353" end="1:12.567">I</span> <span begin="1:12.567" end="1:13.162">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:13.162" end="1:13.614">make</span> <span begin="1:13.614" end="1:15.770">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我没有伪装 也没有刻意制造时间</span></p><p begin="1:16.668" end="1:22.909" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.668" end="1:16.832">But</span> <span begin="1:16.832" end="1:17.010">if</span> <span begin="1:17.010" end="1:17.308">you</span> <span begin="1:17.308" end="1:17.925">need</span> <span begin="1:17.925" end="1:18.338">dick</span> <span begin="1:18.338" end="1:18.806">I</span> <span begin="1:18.806" end="1:19.884">got</span> <span begin="1:19.884" end="1:20.286">you</span> <span begin="1:20.286" end="1:20.539">and</span> <span begin="1:20.539" end="1:20.796">I</span> <span begin="1:20.796" end="1:21.422">yam</span> <span begin="1:21.422" end="1:21.867">from</span> <span begin="1:21.867" end="1:22.269">the</span> <span begin="1:22.269" end="1:22.909">line</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但是如果你需要誓言 我会向你承诺 我会不惜一切为你争取</span></p><p begin="1:23.365" end="1:26.560" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.365" end="1:23.611">Pour</span> <span begin="1:23.611" end="1:24.037">up</span> <span begin="1:24.037" end="1:24.283">for</span> <span begin="1:24.283" end="1:24.916">A</span><span begin="1:24.916" end="1:26.560">$AP</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">向A$AP Yams致以敬意</span></p><p begin="1:26.861" end="1:29.424" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.861" end="1:27.058">R.</span><span begin="1:27.058" end="1:27.286">I.</span><span begin="1:27.286" end="1:27.723">P.</span> <span begin="1:27.723" end="1:28.374">Pimp</span> <span begin="1:28.374" end="1:29.424">C</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">为为嘻哈传奇Pimp C深感惋惜</span></p><p begin="1:30.326" end="1:36.810" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.326" end="1:30.564">R.</span><span begin="1:30.564" end="1:30.802">I.</span><span begin="1:30.802" end="1:31.251">P.</span> <span begin="1:31.251" end="1:31.824">Tray</span><span begin="1:31.824" end="1:33.081">von,</span> <span begin="1:33.228" end="1:33.408">that</span> <span begin="1:33.408" end="1:33.619">nig</span><span begin="1:33.619" end="1:33.873">ga</span> <span begin="1:33.873" end="1:34.072">look</span> <span begin="1:34.072" end="1:34.517">just</span> <span begin="1:34.517" end="1:35.150">like</span> <span begin="1:35.150" end="1:36.810">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">为特雷文（2·26美国黑人男孩被杀案受害者），一个看起来像我一样的家伙深感惋惜</span></p><p begin="1:38.608" end="1:45.836" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.608" end="1:41.047">Woo,</span> <span begin="1:41.293" end="1:41.594">fu</span><span begin="1:41.594" end="1:42.164">ckin&apos;</span> <span begin="1:42.164" end="1:42.387">buz</span><span begin="1:42.387" end="1:43.921">zin&apos;,</span> <span begin="1:43.921" end="1:45.836">woo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">哇，真他妈烦人，哇</span></p><p begin="1:45.981" end="1:49.181" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.981" end="1:46.183">That</span> <span begin="1:46.183" end="1:46.451">my</span> <span begin="1:46.451" end="1:46.580">lit</span><span begin="1:46.580" end="1:46.858">tle</span> <span begin="1:46.858" end="1:47.037">cou</span><span begin="1:47.037" end="1:47.276">sin,</span> <span begin="1:47.511" end="1:47.717">he</span> <span begin="1:47.717" end="1:47.939">got</span> <span begin="1:47.939" end="1:48.165">a</span> <span begin="1:48.165" end="1:48.326">lit</span><span begin="1:48.326" end="1:48.590">tle</span> <span begin="1:48.590" end="1:49.181">trade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的小堂弟做起了一桩小生意</span></p><p begin="1:51.095" end="1:54.237" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.095" end="1:51.287">His</span> <span begin="1:51.287" end="1:51.692">girl</span> <span begin="1:51.692" end="1:51.860">keep</span> <span begin="1:51.860" end="1:52.082">the</span> <span begin="1:52.082" end="1:52.544">scales,</span> <span begin="1:52.752" end="1:52.915">a</span> <span begin="1:52.915" end="1:53.118">lit</span><span begin="1:53.118" end="1:53.429">tle</span> <span begin="1:53.429" end="1:53.847">mer</span><span begin="1:53.847" end="1:54.237">maid</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他的女朋友没少受惩罚 就像小美人鱼一样</span></p><p begin="1:54.709" end="1:57.751" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.709" end="1:54.893">We</span> <span begin="1:54.893" end="1:55.131">out</span> <span begin="1:55.131" end="1:55.334">by</span> <span begin="1:55.334" end="1:55.556">the</span> <span begin="1:55.556" end="1:55.940">pool,</span> <span begin="1:56.221" end="1:56.389">some</span> <span begin="1:56.389" end="1:56.554">lit</span><span begin="1:56.554" end="1:56.850">tle</span> <span begin="1:56.850" end="1:57.284">mer</span><span begin="1:57.284" end="1:57.751">maids</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们在泳池边看见了几条美人鱼</span></p><p begin="1:58.177" end="1:59.482" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.177" end="1:58.360">Me</span> <span begin="1:58.360" end="1:58.585">and</span> <span begin="1:58.585" end="1:59.028">them</span> <span begin="1:59.028" end="1:59.482">gel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我和他们都喷了发胶</span></p><p begin="1:59.700" end="2:01.366" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.700" end="1:59.848">Like</span> <span begin="1:59.848" end="2:00.309">twigs</span> <span begin="2:00.309" end="2:00.495">with</span> <span begin="2:00.495" end="2:00.719">them</span> <span begin="2:00.719" end="2:01.366">bangs</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">好像刘海上长出了细枝</span></p><p begin="2:02.741" end="2:04.841" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.741" end="2:02.908">Now</span> <span begin="2:02.908" end="2:03.104">that&apos;s</span> <span begin="2:03.104" end="2:03.361">a</span> <span begin="2:03.361" end="2:03.813">real</span> <span begin="2:03.813" end="2:04.259">mer</span><span begin="2:04.259" end="2:04.841">maid</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">既然这是条真正的美人鱼</span></p><p begin="2:05.181" end="2:07.732" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.181" end="2:05.340">You</span> <span begin="2:05.340" end="2:05.489">been</span> <span begin="2:05.489" end="2:05.621">hol</span><span begin="2:05.621" end="2:05.794">ding</span> <span begin="2:05.794" end="2:06.207">your</span> <span begin="2:06.207" end="2:07.732">breath</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你一直在屏息很久</span></p><p begin="2:08.386" end="2:11.742" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:08.386" end="2:08.710">Weigh</span><span begin="2:08.710" end="2:10.009">ted</span> <span begin="2:10.009" end="2:11.742">down</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不断下沉</span></p><p begin="2:12.500" end="2:17.064" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.500" end="2:12.934">Punk</span> <span begin="2:12.934" end="2:13.464">ma</span><span begin="2:13.464" end="2:14.214">dre</span> <span begin="2:14.214" end="2:14.625">punk</span> <span begin="2:14.625" end="2:15.254">pa</span><span begin="2:15.254" end="2:17.064">pá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">虚伪的爸爸妈妈</span></p><p begin="2:19.481" end="2:21.519" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:19.481" end="2:19.645">He</span> <span begin="2:19.645" end="2:19.946">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="2:19.946" end="2:20.589">care</span> <span begin="2:20.589" end="2:20.987">for</span> <span begin="2:20.987" end="2:21.519">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他不喜欢我</span></p><p begin="2:22.936" end="2:24.895" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.936" end="2:23.127">But</span> <span begin="2:23.127" end="2:23.375">he</span> <span begin="2:23.375" end="2:24.021">cares</span> <span begin="2:24.021" end="2:24.465">for</span> <span begin="2:24.465" end="2:24.895">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但是他又关心我</span></p><p begin="2:26.250" end="2:30.559" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.250" end="2:26.406">And</span> <span begin="2:26.406" end="2:26.747">that&apos;s</span> <span begin="2:26.747" end="2:29.972">good</span> <span begin="2:29.972" end="2:30.156">e</span><span begin="2:30.156" end="2:30.559">nough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那已经很好了</span></p><p begin="2:33.310" end="2:35.902" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.310" end="2:33.455">We</span> <span begin="2:33.455" end="2:33.848">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="2:33.848" end="2:34.477">talk</span> <span begin="2:34.477" end="2:35.106">much</span> <span begin="2:35.106" end="2:35.325">or</span> <span begin="2:35.325" end="2:35.543">no</span><span begin="2:35.543" end="2:35.902">thin&apos;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们谈的话不多也不少</span></p><p begin="2:36.581" end="2:39.596" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:36.581" end="2:36.816">But</span> <span begin="2:36.816" end="2:36.987">when</span> <span begin="2:36.987" end="2:37.248">we</span> <span begin="2:37.248" end="2:37.682">tal</span><span begin="2:37.682" end="2:37.920">kin&apos;</span> <span begin="2:37.920" end="2:38.574">&apos;bout</span> <span begin="2:38.574" end="2:38.791">some</span><span begin="2:38.791" end="2:39.596">thin&apos;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但是当我们谈论某件事时</span></p><p begin="2:40.210" end="2:44.634" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:40.210" end="2:40.276">We</span> <span begin="2:40.276" end="2:40.722">have</span> <span begin="2:40.722" end="2:42.026">good</span> <span begin="2:43.875" end="2:44.048">dis</span><span begin="2:44.048" end="2:44.239">cus</span><span begin="2:44.239" end="2:44.634">sion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可以很好地交流</span></p><p begin="2:47.205" end="2:53.175" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:47.205" end="2:47.360">I</span> <span begin="2:47.360" end="2:47.566">met</span> <span begin="2:47.566" end="2:47.796">his</span> <span begin="2:47.796" end="2:48.379">friends</span> <span begin="2:48.379" end="2:48.967">last</span> <span begin="2:48.967" end="2:49.487">week</span> <span begin="2:50.575" end="2:50.742">feels</span> <span begin="2:50.742" end="2:50.939">like</span> <span begin="2:50.939" end="2:51.204">they&apos;re</span> <span begin="2:51.204" end="2:51.766">up</span> <span begin="2:51.766" end="2:52.500">to</span> <span begin="2:52.500" end="2:52.719">some</span><span begin="2:52.719" end="2:53.175">thin&apos;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">上周我遇见了他的朋友 感觉像他们在策划什么事情</span></p><p begin="2:54.210" end="2:58.694" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:54.210" end="2:54.632">That&apos;s</span> <span begin="2:54.632" end="2:57.992">good</span> <span begin="2:57.992" end="2:58.156">for</span> <span begin="2:58.156" end="2:58.694">us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那对我们十分有益</span></p><p begin="3:00.800" end="3:02.201" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:00.800" end="3:00.882">We&apos;ll</span> <span begin="3:00.882" end="3:00.982">let</span> <span begin="3:00.982" end="3:01.157">you</span> <span begin="3:01.157" end="3:01.468">guys</span> <span begin="3:01.468" end="3:01.612">pro</span><span begin="3:01.612" e