crum</span><span begin="3:30.829" end="3:31.003">bles</span> <span begin="3:31.003" end="3:31.143">in</span> <span begin="3:31.143" end="3:31.301">the</span> <span begin="3:31.301" end="3:31.423">glit</span><span begin="3:31.423" end="3:31.863">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">野草的残留物也在闪闪发光</span></p><p begin="3:32.891" end="3:35.062" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:32.891" end="3:33.556">Rain,</span> <span begin="3:34.608" end="3:34.690">glit</span><span begin="3:34.690" end="3:35.062">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">雨珠也闪着光</span></p><p begin="3:35.468" end="3:36.999" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:35.468" end="3:35.609">We</span> <span begin="3:35.609" end="3:35.902">laid</span> <span begin="3:35.902" end="3:36.228">out</span> <span begin="3:36.228" end="3:36.345">on</span> <span begin="3:36.345" end="3:36.483">this</span> <span begin="3:36.483" end="3:36.716">wet</span> <span begin="3:36.716" end="3:36.999">floor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们在这潮湿的地板上昏睡过去</span></p><p begin="3:37.286" end="3:38.769" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:37.286" end="3:37.341">A</span><span begin="3:37.341" end="3:37.666">way</span> <span begin="3:37.666" end="3:37.897">turf</span> <span begin="3:37.897" end="3:38.172">no</span> <span begin="3:38.172" end="3:38.426">As</span><span begin="3:38.426" end="3:38.769">tro&apos;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">超越现实 并非虚构</span></p><p begin="3:39.082" end="3:40.571" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:39.082" end="3:39.203">Mes</span><span begin="3:39.203" end="3:39.317">me</span><span begin="3:39.317" end="3:39.652">rized</span> <span begin="3:39.652" end="3:39.767">how</span> <span begin="3:39.767" end="3:39.955">the</span> <span begin="3:39.955" end="3:40.198">strobes</span> <span begin="3:40.198" end="3:40.571">glow</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为闪光灯发出的光而陶醉</span></p><p begin="3:40.848" end="3:42.249" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:40.848" end="3:40.901">Look</span> <span begin="3:40.901" end="3:41.021">at</span> <span begin="3:41.021" end="3:41.172">all</span> <span begin="3:41.172" end="3:41.366">the</span> <span begin="3:41.366" end="3:41.479">peo</span><span begin="3:41.479" end="3:41.669">ple</span> <span begin="3:41.669" end="3:41.930">feet</span> <span begin="3:41.930" end="3:42.249">dance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">看着所有的人都在跳舞</span></p><p begin="3:42.558" end="3:45.644" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:42.558" end="3:42.750">I</span> <span begin="3:42.750" end="3:42.887">know</span> <span begin="3:42.887" end="3:43.013">that</span> <span begin="3:43.013" end="3:43.195">your</span> <span begin="3:43.195" end="3:43.339">nig</span><span begin="3:43.339" end="3:43.541">ga</span> <span begin="3:43.541" end="3:44.027">came</span> <span begin="3:45.205" end="3:45.369">wit&apos;</span> <span begin="3:45.369" end="3:45.644">ya</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道你的他也和你一同前往</span></p><p begin="3:46.642" end="3:49.243" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:46.642" end="3:46.793">But</span> <span begin="3:46.793" end="3:47.057">he</span> <span begin="3:47.057" end="3:47.482">ain&apos;t</span> <span begin="3:48.700" end="3:48.832">wit&apos;</span> <span begin="3:48.832" end="3:49.243">ya</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但是他没有和你在一起</span></p><p begin="3:49.394" end="3:51.508" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:49.394" end="3:49.565">The</span> <span begin="3:49.565" end="3:49.674">on</span><span begin="3:49.674" end="3:49.741">ly</span> <span begin="3:49.741" end="3:49.878">hu</span><span begin="3:49.878" end="3:50.005">man</span> <span begin="3:50.005" end="3:50.146">in</span> <span begin="3:50.146" end="3:50.349">this</span> <span begin="3:50.349" end="3:50.505">hu</span><span begin="3:50.505" end="3:50.644">mid</span> <span begin="3:50.644" end="3:50.826">in</span> <span begin="3:50.826" end="3:50.986">these</span> <span begin="3:50.986" end="3:51.212">Bal</span><span begin="3:51.212" end="3:51.508">mains</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们是这次法国时尚庄园中唯一身上潮湿的人</span></p><p begin="3:51.850" end="3:53.304" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:51.850" end="3:51.891">I</span> <span begin="3:51.891" end="3:51.966">mean</span> <span begin="3:51.966" end="3:52.157">my</span> <span begin="3:52.157" end="3:52.377">balls</span> <span begin="3:52.377" end="3:52.501">sti</span><span begin="3:52.501" end="3:52.708">ckin&apos;</span> <span begin="3:52.708" end="3:52.830">in</span> <span begin="3:52.830" end="3:53.015">my</span> <span begin="3:53.015" end="3:53.304">jeans</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我意思是 我毁掉了我名贵的牛仔裤</span></p><p begin="3:53.517" end="3:55.022" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:53.517" end="3:53.633">We</span> <span begin="3:53.633" end="3:53.719">brea</span><span begin="3:53.719" end="3:53.929">thin&apos;</span> <span begin="3:53.929" end="3:54.137">phere</span><span begin="3:54.137" end="3:54.454">mones,</span> <span begin="3:54.454" end="3:54.557">Am</span><span begin="3:54.557" end="3:54.721">ber</span> <span begin="3:54.721" end="3:55.022">Rose</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们像艾波 罗丝那样去吸引别人</span></p><p begin="3:55.345" end="3:56.730" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:55.345" end="3:55.440">Sip</span><span begin="3:55.440" end="3:55.618">pin&apos;</span> <span begin="3:55.618" end="3:55.870">pink-</span><span begin="3:55.870" end="3:56.150">gold</span> <span begin="3:56.150" end="3:56.258">le</span><span begin="3:56.258" end="3:56.413">mo</span><span begin="3:56.413" end="3:56.730">nades</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">小酌着带有柠檬的黄金啤酒</span></p><p begin="3:57.071" end="3:57.337" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:57.071" end="3:57.144">Fee</span><span begin="3:57.144" end="3:57.337">lin&apos;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">内心这样感觉</span></p><p begin="3:58.355" end="4:02.943" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:58.355" end="3:58.621">I</span> <span begin="3:58.621" end="3:58.843">may</span> <span begin="3:58.843" end="3:59.076">be</span> <span begin="3:59.076" end="3:59.322">youn</span><span begin="3:59.322" end="4:00.206">ger,</span> <span begin="4:00.490" end="4:00.643">but</span> <span begin="4:00.643" end="4:00.949">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="4:00.949" end="4:01.272">look</span> <span begin="4:01.272" end="4:01.627">af</span><span begin="4:01.627" end="4:01.877">ter</span> <span begin="4:01.877" end="4:02.943">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我可能会更年轻 但我会照顾你</span></p><p begin="4:05.401" end="4:10.224" itunes:key="L58" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:05.401" end="4:05.650">We&apos;re</span> <span begin="4:05.650" end="4:05.865">not</span> <span begin="4:05.865" end="4:06.099">in</span> <span begin="4:06.099" end="4:07.118">love,</span> <span begin="4:07.402" end="4:07.616">but</span> <span begin="4:07.616" end="4:07.875">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="4:07.875" end="4:08.227">make</span> <span begin="4:08.227" end="4:08.637">love</span> <span begin="4:08.637" end="4:08.851">to</span> <span begin="4:08.851" end="4:10.224">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们之间没有爱 但是我会向你示爱</span></p><p begin="4:12.143" end="4:17.096" itunes:key="L59" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:12.143" end="4:12.229">When</span> <span begin="4:12.229" end="4:12.664">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="4:12.664" end="4:13.051">not</span> <span begin="4:13.051" end="4:14.117">here,</span> <span begin="4:14.369" end="4:14.686">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="4:14.686" end="4:15.126">save</span> <span begin="4:15.126" end="4:15.631">some</span> <span begin="4:15.631" end="4:15.905">for</span> <span begin="4:15.905" end="4:17.096">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你不在这儿时 我会为你保存些什么东西</span></p><p begin="4:19.485" end="4:24.720" itunes:key="L60" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:19.485" end="4:19.567">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="4:19.567" end="4:20.062">not</span> <span begin="4:20.062" end="4:20.975">him,</span> <span begin="4:21.351" end="4:21.484">but</span> <span begin="4:21.484" end="4:21.807">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="4:21.807" end="4:22.287">mean</span> <span begin="4:22.287" end="4:22.589">some</span><span begin="4:22.589" end="4:22.868">thin&apos;</span> <span begin="4:22.868" end="4:23.299">to</span> <span begin="4:23.299" end="4:24.720">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不是他 但是我对你来说也有一定的意义</span></p><p begin="4:24.852" end="4:31.174" itunes:key="L61" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:24.852" end="4:25.125">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="4:25.125" end="4:26.376">mean</span> <span begin="4:26.376" end="4:26.808">some</span><span begin="4:26.808" end="4:28.254">thing</span> <span begin="4:28.254" end="4:28.458">to</span> <span begin="4:28.458" end="4:31.174">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我对你来说也有一定的意义</span></p><p begin="4:31.861" end="4:38.313" itunes:key="L62" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:31.861" end="4:32.148">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="4:32.148" end="4:33.438">mean</span> <span begin="4:33.438" end="4:33.965">some</span><span begin="4:33.965" end="4:35.327">thing</span> <span begin="4:35.327" end="4:36.497">to</span> <span begin="4:36.497" end="4:38.313">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我对你来说也有一定的意义</span></p><p begin="4:39.852" end="4:45.445" itunes:key="L63" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:39.852" end="4:40.134">You</span> <span begin="4:40.134" end="4:40.302">got</span> <span begin="4:40.302" end="4:40.556">a</span> <span begin="4:40.556" end="4:41.265">room</span><span begin="4:41.265" end="4:41.456">mate</span> <span begin="4:42.055" end="4:42.354">he&apos;ll</span> <span begin="4:42.354" end="4:42.801">hear</span> <span begin="4:42.801" end="4:43.238">what</span> <span begin="4:43.238" end="4:43.447">we</span> <span begin="4:43.447" end="4:45.445">do</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们有个室友 他会听到我们在做什么</span></p><p begin="4:46.836" end="4:52.802" itunes:key="L64" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:46.836" end="4:47.120">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="4:47.120" end="4:47.362">on</span><span begin="4:47.362" end="4:47.640">ly</span> <span begin="4:47.640" end="4:48.081">aw</span><span begin="4:48.081" end="4:48.594">kward</span> <span begin="4:48.904" end="4:49.057">if</span> <span begin="4:49.057" end="4:49.320">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="4:49.320" end="4:49.737">fu</span><span begin="4:49.737" end="4:50.010">cking</span> <span begin="4:50.010" end="4:50.435">him</span> <span begin="4:50.435" end="4:52.802">too</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果你也对他有兴趣的话 那只会觉得尴尬</span></p></div></body></tt>